center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012-2학기 대학원 전적대학원 학점인정 신청에 관한 사항을 안내하오니 해당 학생들은 신청하여 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; </p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><o:p></o:p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">1. 학점인정 대상 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">동일계열 및 동일과정 입학자로서 입학 전 국내？외 대학원에서 취득한 학점이 있는 자</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2. 인정학점(국외 대학원의 경우 학점조정이 이루어 질수 있음)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가.</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"> 석사 : 9학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 박사 : 12학점 이내</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp;&nbsp; (*국외 대학원에서 취득한 학점의 경우 인정학점을 조정할 수 있다)</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">3. 제출서류 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 가. 전적대학원 학점 인정 신청서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 전적대학원 성적증명서 1부.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">4. 제출일자 : </span><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-WEIGHT: bold; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #1fafda\" color=\"#ffffff\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2012. 09. 10(월) ~ 09. 13(목) [4일간]</span></span></font></span></u></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><u style=\"text-underline: #000000 single\"></u>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">5. 제출장소 : 대학원 각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">6. 참고사항 </span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp; 가. 학점인정 방법 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">해당 학과 교육과정에 편성된 과목으로 인정하되 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">학점은 인정되나</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 평점에는 반영되지 않으며 “S”로 표기됨</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">&nbsp; 나. 학점인정 시기 : 신청 당해 학기</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; MARGIN-LEFT: 4em\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림\" lang=\"EN-US\">2012. 08.</span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\">&nbsp; <o:p></o:p></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\" class=\"바탕글\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 굴림; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
